# Customer · No Merchant Dashboard (LOCKED)

## Absolute

- **Storefront customers** (Google / email OTP profile login) **never** receive `/admin`, `/master`, or merchant dashboard access.
- Customer auth = **storefront profile + orders + invoices + tracking + loyalty** only (`/account`, theme profile page).
- **Guest checkout is allowed** — sign-in is optional for placing an order; tracking after purchase may prompt login.
- Public checkout **must not** link to admin URLs, shipping setup links, or merchant panels.

## UI

- Empty shipping / payment states → customer-friendly copy + contact store — **no** “open admin” links.
- Clerk / Google on storefront → `establishStorefrontSession`; **never** auto-navigate to `/admin`.
- Merchant Clerk session stays on `/admin` / `/store/login` only.

## Data

- Shipping, coupons, gift cards, loyalty, tracking, notifications = **live API** per `store_id` — zero mock/hardcoded commerce rows.